name: A bounded advisory draft stays unaccepted and requires a separate explicit search
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_pattern.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_pattern.py before @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | draft-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Advisory-pattern draft: unaccepted | draft-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_pattern.py draft @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | draft-receipt
expect: supplied diff excerpted
ask: Does the draft receipt distinguish supplied context and omitted bytes from verified source, a confirmed finding or accepted future context?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | draft-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: draft-paged-40x12
ask: Are unaccepted status, omitted source, unknown cost and paging readable through the six-size matrix without exposing a patching action?
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/search.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Advisory-guided observations: 0 findings | explicit-search
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_pattern.py search @TMP_TARGET @ART
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | existing-review
expect: Labeled greeting observation
ask: Does the separately requested search preserve human truth and protected Review, with no automatic job or accepted lesson?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | resumed
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_pattern.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart retain the exact draft, omitted-byte receipt, decisions and allowance without another provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
